1
00:00:00,561 --> 00:00:03,441
(Howard:)By her. Oh, look, I did it again.

2
00:00:03,606 --> 00:00:07,486
MISSY: Well, that should do it.
- Thank you for coming by.

3
00:00:13,032 --> 00:00:14,452
(Sheldon:)Hello.

4
00:00:14,617 --> 00:00:18,037
(Leonard:)Oh, hey, buddy.

5
00:00:19,288 --> 00:00:21,458
Buddy?

6
00:00:21,624 --> 00:00:24,004
(Howard:)Sorry I'm late.
I'm working on a project...

7
00:00:24,168 --> 00:00:27,338
(Howard:)...that may take me up
on the next space shuttle.

8
00:00:27,505 --> 00:00:30,385
Well, how can you be late?
I wasn't expecting you at all.

9
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:32,680
(Howard:)Nobody ever expects me.

10
00:00:32,843 --> 00:00:35,843
(Howard:)Sometimes you just look,
and bam, Howard Wolowitz.

11
00:00:37,848 --> 00:00:41,388
- Sheldon, are you gonna introduce us?
- Oh, all right. This is Missy.

12
00:00:41,560 --> 00:00:45,230
(Sheldon:)Missy, this is Leonard and Rajesh,
and you've already met Howard.

13
00:00:45,397 --> 00:00:47,737
- It's nice to meet you.
- You too, as well also.

14
00:00:47,900 --> 00:00:49,280
(Howard:)Yeah.

15
00:00:51,112 --> 00:00:52,742
So how do you two know each other?

16
00:00:53,280 --> 00:01:00,020
(Missy:)Oh, he once spent nine months
with my legs wrapped around his head.

